From 9742813eb7329e3c175d21c66ba961347caff656 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:11:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash routing so backend
 commands do not become prompts

Selected-agent slash messages dispatch through the backend command hook instead of the normal prompt path. That keeps provider-owned commands such as Codex status and fork handling out of title generation and avoids resuming the agent thread when the input is command control rather than user work.
